    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0377" n="279" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg279"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Pro memoria.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chinese Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July 18,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have been requested by Grand Secretary Li Hung Chang to consult your Government
                    as to the possibility of obtaining from the treaty powers either a guaranty of
                    the territorial integrity of China or a self-denying ordinance in any action
                    circumstances may call on them to take in the present disturbed state of the
                    country.</p>
            </div>
